IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `fne-display`

-- Foreign National Emblems (Control of Display) Act 1949, ss 2 to 8 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_foreign-national-emblems-control-of-display-act-1949.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

